### 1. Create tournament
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Inter-Dept Football 2026",
  "sport": "Football",
  "winPoints": 3,
  "drawPoints": 1,
  "lossPoints": 0
}

### 2. Register teams (run all four)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "CSE Strikers" }

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "AI&DS Titans" }

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ECE Warriors" }

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "MECH Bulls" }

### 3. List teams
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/teams

### 4. Generate round-robin fixture
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/fixtures

### 5. View fixture
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/fixtures

### 6. Record result of match 1 (2-1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/result
Content-Type: application/json

{ "homeScore": 2, "awayScore": 1 }

### 7. Record result of match 2 (0-0)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches/2/result
Content-Type: application/json

{ "homeScore": 0, "awayScore": 0 }

### 8. View standings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/standings

### 9. Correct match 1 to 1-1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/result
Content-Type: application/json

{ "homeScore": 1, "awayScore": 1 }

### 10. Standings again
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/standings

### 11. All tournaments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments

### ===== EDGE CASES =====

### E1. Record result twice -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches/1/result
Content-Type: application/json

{ "homeScore": 5, "awayScore": 0 }

### E2. Negative score -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches/3/result
Content-Type: application/json

{ "homeScore": -1, "awayScore": 2 }

### E3. Missing score -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches/3/result
Content-Type: application/json

{ "homeScore": 2 }

### E4. Duplicate team -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "CSE Strikers" }

### E5. Generate fixture again -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/fixtures

### E6. Register team after fixture -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments/1/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Late Team" }

### E7. Bad scoring rule -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tournaments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bad Cup", "sport": "Cricket", "winPoints": 1, "drawPoints": 3, "lossPoints": 0 }

### E8. Unknown match -> 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/matches/999/result
Content-Type: application/json

{ "homeScore": 1, "awayScore": 0 }

### E9. PUT before any result -> 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/matches/3/result
Content-Type: application/json

{ "homeScore": 1, "awayScore": 0 }